Krita Nova 05 - layers docker: hold to drag, menu button for the layer menu (Android)

- Press-and-hold on a layer starts dragging it (reorder) instead of opening the
  context menu; moving before the hold delay still scrolls the list.
- Each layer row gets a small menu button at its leading edge that opens the
  layer context menu (selecting the layer first if needed).

